## Elaborate evaluate-operator copy-desired-info.
sp {agent-world*elaborate*evaluate-operator*copy-desired-info
   :default
   (state <s> ^name evaluate-operator
              ^desireds <desireds>)
   (<desireds> ^duplicate-of <duplicate-desireds>
               ^desired <desired>)
   (<desired> ^duplicate-of <duplicate-desired>)
   (<duplicate-desired> ^info <info>)
-->
